    "intro_html":  "A meatball sub is a wonderful thing that turns into a soggy tragedy about four hours after you build it. So we build it in a pan instead: turkey and smoked sausage meatballs baked in marinara, tucked into split rolls under melted mozzarella, assembled fresh when you eat it. Each serving carries \u003cstrong\u003e{{cal}} calories and {{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
